; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M3: Candles trailing (TrailMode 6), setup 1 of 3: sell, session 1200-2000 server time, trend filter H1 EMA 50, target 1R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the low / high of the last 2 closed M3 candles, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 6, TrailParam 2).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_BTC_M3_Candles_1of3_Sell_1200-2000_H1 in Loma_BTCUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number and the trade comment differ): run one or the other, not both. Its Loma_T15 header gives the one-minute backtest's figures; the replay's are here.
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.42): 122 trades, PF 2.15. Replay of the same months: 122 trades, PF 2.12.
; REPLAY ON BINANCE BTCUSDT ONE-SECOND PRICES (four price points per second; the EA's rules; 10 USD spread, no commission). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 55 trades, PF 1.44, net +6.9R (stressed PF 1.04); the 3 setups of M3 + Candles together 140 trades, PF 1.41, net +16.2R (stressed 1.08).
; Candles trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M3 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 2024, 65 trades, PF 0.73; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 58 trades, PF 1.10. The 3 setups together: 2024, 271 trades, PF 0.82; 2023 (from 15 Jan), 242 trades, PF 0.84. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
